3. A same-raw, different-witness Proposal that meets a Recovery owner is an
   explicit mutation-free retained-ingress disposition. It is not reconstructed
   from `PlanError::PayloadVariant` at the service boundary. The existing owner
   and its charge remain unchanged, and relay behavior is not broadened by this
   Proposal-only result.
4. Authority status lookup and detailed transaction lookup are distinct read
   products. Status never computes replacement-fee detail. Detailed minimum
   replacement fee remains optional; representational overflow yields `None`,
   matching the develop compatibility boundary, while a contradictory owner
   projection remains structural.

